GUEST-REFUSE SafeArraySetRecordInfo
GUEST-REFUSE SafeArrayUnaccessData
GUEST-REFUSE SafeArrayUnlock
GUEST-REFUSE SetErrorInfo
GUEST-REFUSE VARIANT_UserFree
